      "description": "⚠️ Deprecated APIs\n\nThis folder contains Version 1 (V1) API endpoints that are no longer actively maintained and have been deprecated. These endpoints are kept for reference and backward compatibility purposes only.\n\n**Current endpoints:**\n- **V1 - Get User By ID**: Retrieves a user by their ID via the legacy `/api/v1/users/:id` route.\n\n> **Note:** It is recommended to migrate to the latest API versions available in the User Management folder. Deprecated endpoints may be removed in future releases."
